# Creative Certificate Update

This build upgrades the Firewall Academy X certificate with:
- custom inline shield logo
- certificate crest/seal
- Firewall, Secure, Verified and Authentic security marks
- redesigned QR verification block
- clean certificate ID display (no long URL shown)
- creative downloadable/printable certificate
- responsive certificate layout
- offline-safe inline logo artwork

The certificate keeps the existing verification flow and certificate data.
